sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant S as Server
    actor DB as Database
    U->>+S: Sign in
    S->>DB: Look up user
    DB-->>S: Row
    alt valid password
        S-->>-U: Welcome back
    else wrong password
        S--xU: Access denied
    end
    Note over U,S: Session starts
    loop Every minute
        U-)S: Heartbeat
    end
